    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d460-a1">

                <pb facs="0859" n="755" sameAs="frus:frus1943CairoTehran/pg755"/>

                <head>ANNEX A</head>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Air preparations and other supplies till 15 February.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Discussion of war plans.</item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>Programme of munitions import.</item>
                    <label>4.</label>
                    <item>Discussion of political questions.</item>
                </list>
                <pb facs="0860" n="756" xml:id="pg756"/>
                <p>15th February. Allies ask permission to “fly in”.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">if reply negative</hi>.</p>
                <p>Allies direct all resources to another theatre and must abandon hope of wartime
                    cooperation with Turkey.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">if reply “Yes”</hi>.</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Continuation at fullest speed of programme of import munitions for army
                        and air.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Opening of the sea route to Turkey.</item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>Reinforcement by British anti-tank and armoured units.</item>
                    <label>4.</label>
                    <item>Execution of agreed plan with full force of Allies and Turkey.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
